message: "If you use this study or replication package, please cite Saeid Homayoun and the MNSc–FamaFrench–01 GitHub study page."
title: "When Data Construction Changes Asset Pricing: The FIZ–CIZ Transition and the Stability of Fama–French Factors"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Homayoun"
    given-names: "Saeid"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2536-0446"
