url: "https://github.com/Saehon/Saeid-Homayoun/tree/main/studies/MNSc-FamaFrench-01"
abstract: >-
  MNSc–FamaFrench–01 is an ECONOVA-S research study and replication package examining the stability of Fama–French factors, benchmark portfolios, asset-pricing alphas, and statistical conclusions across official July 2024 FIZ-era and July 2025 CIZ-era Kenneth R. French archive snapshots. The study is governed as a reproducibility and measurement-change project and does not treat the two-vintage comparison as identifying the pure causal effect of the FIZ-to-CIZ transition.
